itten på mörkgrön botten",3,"stable",true,240],["geo.NP.flag","NP",1,"two stacked pennants rather than a rectangle, carrying a white moon and a white sun","två staplade vimplar i stället för en rektangel, med en vit måne och en vit sol",2,"stable",true,241],["geo.EG.flag","EG",1,"three horizontal bands — red, white, black — with a golden eagle in the middle","tre vågräta band — rött, vitt, svart — med en gyllene örn i mitten",3,"stable",true,242],["geo.MA.flag","MA",1,"a green five-pointed star outlined on a red field","en grön femuddig stjärna i konturlinje på röd botten",3,"stable",true,243],["geo.DZ.flag","DZ",1,"green and white side by side, with a red crescent and star where they meet","grönt och vitt sida vid sida, med en röd halvmåne och stjärna där de möts",3,"stable",true,244],["geo.TN.flag","TN",1,"a red crescent and star inside a white circle, on a red field","en röd halvmåne och stjärna inuti en vit cirkel, på röd botten",3,"stable",true,245],["geo.NG.flag","NG",1,"three vertical bands — green, white, green","tre lodräta band — grönt, vitt, grönt",3,"stable",true,246],["geo.GH.flag","GH",1,"three horizontal bands — red, yellow, green — with a black star in the middle","tre vågräta band — rött, gult, grönt — med en svart stjärna i mitten",3,"stable",true,247],["geo.SN.flag","SN",1,"three vertical bands — green, yellow, red — with a green star in the middle","tre lodräta band — grönt, gult, rött — med en grön stjärna i mitten",4,"stable",true,248],["geo.ML.flag","ML",1,"three vertical bands — green, yellow, red","tre lodräta band — grönt, gult, rött",5,"stable",true,249],["geo.KE.flag","KE",1,"three horizontal bands — black, red, green — with a Maasai shield and spears in the middle","tre vågräta band — svart, rött, grönt — med en masajsköld och spjut i mitten",3,"stable",true,250],["geo.ET.flag","ET",1,"three horizontal bands — green, yellow, red — with a yellow star on a blue circle in the middle","tre vågräta band — grönt, gult, rött — med en gul stjärn